<style>
th, td {
  border:1px solid black;
}
body {
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
}
</style>

<body>

<b>FPD Called Price Approval Request</b></br></br>

Net unit price is bellow the Floor Price OR over 10,000 ST </br></br>

Hello {!Recipient.name} </br></br>

A order for {!OrderItem.Order} has been submitted for your approval by </br>{!OrderItem.Order}.
The order is {!Order.Link} </br></br>

<b>Quote Summary</b> </br></br>

<b>Customer Name:</b> {!OrderItem.Order} </br>
<b>Quote Description: </b> {!OrderItem.Order} </br>
<b>Quote Issue Date:</b> {!OrderItem.Order} </br>
<b>Contract Validity: </b>{!OrderItem.Order} </br>
<b>Currency: </b>{!OrderItem.Order} </br></br>

<b>Submitter Comments: </b> {!OrderItem.Order} </br> </br>

<b>Quote Line Information</b> </br> </br>

<table style="width:100%">
  <tr>
    <th>Order Line</th>
    <th>Order Number</th>
    <th>SAP Order Number</th>
    <th>Contract Number</th>
    <th>Customer</th>
    <th>Ship To</th>
    <th>Account Name</th>
    <th>Product</th>
    <th>Quantity</th>
    <th>Price by date</th>
    <th>List Price</th>
    <th>Agreed Final Price</th>
    <th>Status</th>
    <th>Integration Message</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>{!OrderItem.LineNumber}</td>
    <td>data</td>
    <td>data</td>
  </tr>
</table>
</body>